{"id":"657640","name":"炒年糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657640/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕","amount":"100g"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"2根"},{"name":"土鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半块"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"年糕料","amount":"1包"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"年糕、年糕料包、生菜、鸡蛋、洋葱、火腿肠。","img":"images/657640/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"年糕放入锅内煮一煮。","img":"images/657640/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"浮起后捞出。","img":"images/657640/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋入锅煎。","img":"images/657640/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋煎成块，装碗备用。","img":"images/657640/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"火腿肠入锅煎香。","img":"images/657640/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入洋葱翻炒出香气。","img":"images/657640/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"生菜和鸡蛋倒入。","img":"images/657640/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入年糕料包。","img":"images/657640/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入年糕。","img":"images/657640/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入酱油调味，咕咚一会儿即可。","img":"images/657640/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657640/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}